       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Guidance on how to interpret the value by comparison to a normal or recommended range.  Multiple reference ranges are interpreted as an \"OR\".   In other words, to represent two distinct target populations, two `referenceRange` elements would be used." ] ;
